      <title>中国程序员为何两年不学新东西：舒适区陷阱与突破路径</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%A6%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E8%88%92%E9%80%82%E5%8C%BA%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1%E4%B8%8E%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84/</link>
